            { "en": "borrow", "zh": "借（入）" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "en": "Up to ten books for two weeks.",
          "zh": "最多十本，借期两周。",
          "keyExpressions": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "Thank you. That's great.",
          "zh": "谢谢。太好了。",
          "keyExpressions": []
        }
      ],
      "tipsZh": [
        "Library card 是借书证，通常免费办。",
        "Borrow 是借进来，return 是还回去。",
        "图书馆里有免费电脑和 Wi-Fi，也能安静自习。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "post-office-west",
      "titleEn": "At the Post Office",
      "titleZh": "在邮局寄包裹",
      "descZh": "在邮局寄包裹回国，问价格和填写地址的说法。",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "I want to mail this box to China.",
          "zh": "我想把这个箱子寄到中国。",
          "keyExpressions": [
            { "en": "mail this box to ...", "zh": "把这个箱子寄到……" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "en": "Okay. Does it have anything liquid?",
          "zh": "好的。里面有液体吗？",
          "keyExpressions": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "No, just books and clothes.",
          "zh": "没有，只有书和衣服。",
          "keyExpressions": []
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "en": "Please write the address here.",
          "zh": "请把地址写在这里。",
          "keyExpressions": [
            { "en": "write the address here", "zh": "把地址写在这里" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "How much does it cost?",
          "zh": "寄这个多少钱？",
          "keyExpressions": [
            { "en": "How much does it cost?", "zh": "多少钱？" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "en": "About twenty dollars by air.",
          "zh": "空运大约二十美元。",
          "keyExpressions": [
            { "en": "by air", "zh": "空运" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "en": "That's fine. Thank you.",
          "zh": "可以。谢谢。",
          "keyExpressions": []
        }
      ],
      "tipsZh": [
        "寄东西说 mail 或 send，寄包裹是 send a package。",
        "液体、电池不能随便寄，柜台会问 liquid。",
        "按重量和运输方式算钱，空运 by air 比海运贵。"
      ]
    },
